strengths.value:
- This work focuses on customizing text-conditioned diffusion models for few-shot action image generation, which is an interesting and meaningful topic;
- The motivation of decoupling action and actor for action image generation is good, and the proposed textual action space is novel and effective in achieving the decoupling.  
- The proposed method is easy to understand, and the writing is good.

